description:
New endpoint at auth.rosary.bot (rig CF Worker) that accepts a signet bridge cert, validates it against the CA, reads PolicyStatement claims, maps to GitHub permissions via sigpol, and returns a scoped GitHub App installation token.

Flow: POST /api/github/token { cert: base64(bridge_cert_DER) } → validate cert chain → extract sigpol claims → map to GH perms → POST /app/installations/{id}/access_tokens → return { token, expires_at, permissions, repositories }

This is the critical integration point between signet identity and GitHub access control.
